        "action": "Public inquiry into pattern of withdrawals of local funding for pride events",
        "additional_details": "I think they have been removed without a good reason.",
        "background": "Many local councils have pulled support for local pride events that which had previously received funding, resulting in trade unions paying for expenses. I ask for a statutory public inquiry into the reason why funds have been withdrawn from these LGBT Pride events.",
